 calculate cumulative ≥1-dose COVID-19 vaccination coverage as of August 31, 2022.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Differences in ≥1-dose coverage were assessed by race and ethnicity and stratified by sociodemographic subgroups.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Survey weights were used to adjust to the noninstitutionalized U.S. population of children and adolescents and to calibrate to CDC vaccine administration data.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"For all analyses, p-values <0.05 were considered statistically significant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Estimates were suppressed because they did not meet standards for data reliability (CI >20, relative SE >30, or sample size <30).\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}